(7079180, 1077046, 100975, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I don''t know what to think about the white lines...rain.  I would like to know your explanation of how this fits.  Maybe I would bump the score up if it made sense to me.  I can see that the two figures are mostly shadow, but the light on the rain doesn''t fit to me.  Also the figure on the left is wearing a striped shirt that does not appear to be black, so it seems like the processing made the images black and not the subject itself...</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I don''t know what to think about the white lines...rain.  I would like to know your explanation of how this fits.  Maybe I would bump the score up if it made sense to me.  I can see that the two figures are mostly shadow, but the light on the rain doesn''t fit to me.  Also the figure on the left is wearing a striped shirt that does not appear to be black, so it seems like the processing made the images black and not the subject itself...', '2013-07-31 01:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
