(7079183, 1077001, 100975, '<td valign="top">The background was probably black, but the lighting made it brownish.  Maybe a little adjustment with brightness and contrast would have helped the image out in my opinion.  Lots of black, but too much color in it for me.</td>', 'The background was probably black, but the lighting made it brownish.  Maybe a little adjustment with brightness and contrast would have helped the image out in my opinion.  Lots of black, but too much color in it for me.', '2013-07-31 02:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
