(7079466, 1077339, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this image, but I feel that the composition is off. Perhaps bringing the hat closer to the edge, reducing the blank space in between, and a tighter crop. I also don''t think this should have been converted to b/w for the challenge, as the hat is obviously black, and if the trunk had other tones, those could have been adjusted.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this image, but I feel that the composition is off. Perhaps bringing the hat closer to the edge, reducing the blank space in between, and a tighter crop. I also don''t think this should have been converted to b/w for the challenge, as the hat is obviously black, and if the trunk had other tones, those could have been adjusted.', '2013-07-31 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
