(7082290, 1077409, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and GREAT job of getting all that detail in a black-on-black. Ribbon prospect here I would think.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and GREAT job of getting all that detail in a black-on-black. Ribbon prospect here I would think.', '2013-08-06 02:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
