(7082292, 1077519, 97225, '<td valign="top">Photos of cameras usually don''t do anything for me (yeah, I know, wash my mouth out, huh?) BUT  this one is great. You have made a beautiful image with this lovely, well cared for antique. I love the details of its style and the hints of its history in the signs of wear and tear - and of course the reflection. Top 5</td>', 'Photos of cameras usually don''t do anything for me (yeah, I know, wash my mouth out, huh?) BUT  this one is great. You have made a beautiful image with this lovely, well cared for antique. I love the details of its style and the hints of its history in the signs of wear and tear - and of course the reflection. Top 5', '2013-08-06 02:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
