(7082669, 1077307, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think your black swan might be a white duck. I like the unpretentiousness of this photo. I feel comfortable with it. The light on either side of the frame is actually quite lovely.</td>', 'I think your black swan might be a white duck. I like the unpretentiousness of this photo. I feel comfortable with it. The light on either side of the frame is actually quite lovely.', '2013-08-06 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
