(7083379, 1077107, 61679, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> Cutie!  What kinda poochy?  Water dog?  His face looks a lot like our <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077522" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sophie</a> but I bet Moe is bigger. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Moe is a Cockapoo or maybe a Cockapoo mix.  We fostered him for a month from <a href="//www.sicsa.org" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SICSA</a> before we adopted him.  He isn''t very big, around 15 pounds.<br/> <br/>He was also my subject in the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=74588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Cutout</a> challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1073064" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1769/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1073064.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1769/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1073064.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1769/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1073064.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Tim<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-07 15:10:11.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: Cutie!  What kinda poochy?  Water dog?  His face looks a lot like our Sophie but I bet Moe is bigger.   Moe is a Cockapoo or maybe a Cockapoo mix.  We fostered him for a month from SICSA before we adopted him.  He isn''t very big, around 15 pounds. He was also my subject in the  Cutout challenge.  Tim', '2013-08-07 16:06:54.000000', '2013-08-07 16:10:11.000000', 0),
(7083392, 1077431, 130561, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by stphq:</b></div><hr/><i> Well done Sam.. a ribbon on second entry, thats fantastic... :) ..and now i''ve seen the colour one, you were right to enter the b/w shot, good call mate. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks stphq :0)</td>', 'Originally posted by stphq: Well done Sam.. a ribbon on second entry, thats fantastic... :) ..and now i''ve seen the colour one, you were right to enter the b/w shot, good call mate.   Thanks stphq :0)', '2013-08-07 17:11:52.000000', NULL, 0),
