(7083479, 1077545, 87808, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you have two comments that are pretty much opposite  of each other here. Depending on the screen tilt!  So I think , for you, that maybe you should look at your screen and see it my way then Tang''s way and find a middle ground, as then you will be pretty much calibrated.  Hope that helps</td>', 'Interesting that you have two comments that are pretty much opposite  of each other here. Depending on the screen tilt!  So I think , for you, that maybe you should look at your screen and see it my way then Tang''s way and find a middle ground, as then you will be pretty much calibrated.  Hope that helps', '2013-08-07 20:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
